 cadherin family: evidence for eight new cadherins in nervous tissue</article-title><source>Cell Regul</source><year>1991</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>261</fpage><lpage>270</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2059658</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Takeichi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cadherin cell adhesion receptors as a morphogenetic regulator</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1991</year><volume>251</volume><fpage>1451</fpage><lpage>1455</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2006419</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="other">Warren, J.B. 1990. Large vessel endothelial isolation. <italic>In</italic> The Endothelium: An  Introduction to Current Research. J.B. Warren, editor. Wiley-Liss, Inc., New  York. 263&#x02013;272.</citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Risau</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Zerwes</surname><given-names>HG</given-names></name><name><surname>Drexler</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Aguzzi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Wagner</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Endothelioma cells expressing the polyoma middle T oncogene induce hemangiomas by host cell recruitment</article-title><source>Cell</source><year>1989</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>1053</fpage><lpage>1063</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2736622</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Z&#x000f6;llner</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Vestweber</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The E-selectin liga